==Polish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pl|sla-pro|*volxъ}}, itself taken from {{der|pl|gem-pro|*walhaz|t=Roman, Romance}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|Vlach}}, {{m|en|Wallachia}}, {{m|en|Wales}}, {{m|en|walnut}}.<ref>{{cite book|author=Rebecca Posner|title=The Romance Languages: A Linguistic Introduction|location=New York|year=1966|page=271}}.</ref>

